    "sources": "The GWAS Catalog and the Open Targets Platform hold variant-trait association statistics for thousands of traits on the same identifiers (known resources; the paper's own supplementary table ST1 links 30 of its inputs to GWAS Catalog study pages, which I read). Other genomic structural equation modelling factor GWAS exist too, including a 2026 Nature Communications study of shared psychiatric-physical liability found in search.",
    "approx_items": null,
    "join_key": "rsID, or GRCh37 chromosome:base position",
    "why": "Plenty of external labelled variant-trait data exists for training and for an out-of-sample check, which is the one genuinely strong feature of this candidate."
